y":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-09T15:03:00-07:00","id":1552244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yue Ryong</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1552205-exalted-shard-idea-working-title-exalted-dawning-in-the-now?p=1552233#post1552233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Little difficult to comment if the link isn't public.</div> </div> </div> </div>fixed, sorry about that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-10T13:12:37-07:00","id":1552272,"title":"","content":"Sorry, is this intended for 3e or 2.5e? Several of the Charms only make sense in one or the other, and the whole thing is littered with keywords that aren't explained (Protector) or are used in the wrong context (Solar Charms with Aura, Aura with no Elemental keyword). The &quot;for 2.5e errata&quot; version of a Charm works completely differently even when there's no reason for it to do so compared to a 3e version.<br /> <br /> One Charm has a prerequisite of Craft (Air), another references the Compulsion keyword, both 2e rules. But another uses Dual, a 3e mechanic. Iron Kettle Body (reusing a Solar Charm's name for a Lunar Charm) references environmental hazard levels, which don't exist in any edition to my knowledge. I could honestly go on. Just about every Charm has something wrong with it just on a technical level, even before we get to balancing or redundancy with existing Charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/396-mr-rage","name":"Mr Rage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-14T12:19:05-07:00","id":1552384,"title":"","content":"it's intended primarily for 3e but also be able to be used with 2.5, again this was made with AI and I'm working on getting some of the stuff sorted out so it's more consistent and clear<br /> <br /> an example of that is I'm not sure I'm going to actually go with the idea that its just Exalted popped up in the normal modern day world, I think that looses a ton of lore and story and I'm going to change that to reflect Exalted base game happened, other stuff happend &lt;fill in your story hooks here for whatever happened to turn Exalted into Earth and our universe in general&gt;, Exalted on Earth slowly returning because XYZ things happened and now Exalts exist in the normal modern world, I'll probably even push the story so that lesser gods and godbloods start coming back first until some mystical threshold is hit then dragonbloods come back first, then alchemicals, lunars, and sidereals next, then solar tier Exalts start popping up<br /> <br /> Thank you for the feed back though, I'm garbage with crunch but I can do fairly well fluffing up something<br /> <br /> it's been several years since I created a thread turning real world weird plants and fruits into something for exalted, like dragon fruit growing at the elemental poles being how humans became dragonbloods, if they were able to survive the elemental exaltation being ignited in their blood","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}